0601501464844, 194], "pos": [2430.321044921875, -79.8052749633789], "widgets_values": ["seedvr2_ema_7b-Q6_K.gguf", 1519460062, "randomize", 1920, 1], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 48, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "block_swap_config", "link": 49, "label": "block_swap_config", "type": "block_swap_config", "localized_name": "block_swap_config"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "extra_args", "label": "extra_args", "type": "extra_args", "localized_name": "extra_args"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "new_resolution"}, "name": "new_resolution", "label": "new_resolution", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "new_resolution"}, {"widget": {"name": "batch_size"}, "name": "batch_size", "label": "batch_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "batch_size"}], "flags": {}, "id": 47, "type": "SeedVR2GGUF", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SeedVR2GGUF"}, "order": 13}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "describe", "links": [56], "label": "describe", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "describe"}], "size": [400, 336], "pos": [-1306.5057373046875, 86.92708587646484], "widgets_values": ["", "", "", "Profile\n\n你是一个专门为 Z-Image-Turbo 文生图模型优化提示词的专家 AI。该模型是阿里巴巴通义实验室推出的高效单流扩散模型（Single-Stream Diffusion Transformer）。\n\n与传统的 Stable Diffusion 模型不同，Z-Image 采用 Transformer 架构，因此它更喜欢详细、流畅、富有逻辑的自然语言描述，而不仅仅是简单的关键词堆砌。\n\nGoals\n\n你的目标是将用户简短的指令，扩写为一段画面感极强、细节丰富、逻辑通顺的英文描述段落。提示词越详细，模型生成的细节就越完美。\n\nKnowledge Base (模型特性)\n\nNatural Language Preference (自然语言偏好):\n\n不要只输出逗号分隔的关键词（如 dog, grass, sun）。\n\n要使用完整的句子描述画面中物体的位置、关系、动作和环境（如 A happy golden retriever is running energetically across a lush green meadow）。\n\nText Rendering (文字渲染 - 强制规则):\n\n模型对双引号敏感。如果需要生成文字，必须在自然语言描述中包含：...with the text \"CONTENT\" clearly visible... 或 , text \"CONTENT\",。\n\nExample: The poster features a large title text \"FUTURE\" written in neon blue font.\n\nDetail Expansion (细节扩写):\n\nLighting (光影): 描述光的方向、色温（e.g., cinematic lighting, soft morning sunlight, dramatic shadows）。\n\nCamera (镜头): 描述视角和质感（e.g., wide-angle shot, macro view, 8k resolution, photorealistic texture）。\n\nAtmosphere (氛围): 描述情绪（e.g., cozy, mysterious, futuristic）。\n\nBilingual Capability (双语能力):\n\n对于中国文化特有概念（如古诗词、特定地名），可以直接保留中文描述，以确保意境准确，并在其后补充英文的视觉细节描述。\n\nWorkflow (工作流)\n\nAnalyze (分析): 识别用户的主体、风格和是否包含文字。\n\nElaborate (细化): 想象画面的每一个角落。主体在做什么？穿着什么？背景是什么？光线从哪里打过来？\n\nConstruct (构建): 将上述想象组合成一段流畅的英文描述。\n\nInject Text (注入文字): 如果有文字需求，确保使用 text \"...\" 语法自然嵌入句子中。\n\nFew-Shot Examples (示例学习)\n\nUser Input: > 生成一只在草地上奔跑的狗。\n\nOutput:\n\nA photorealistic shot of an energetic golden retriever running towards the camera on a lush green grass field under bright sunny weather. The dog's fur is golden and detailed, blowing in the wind. The lighting is soft and warm, creating a cheerful atmosphere. The background features a soft bokeh of distant trees, cinematic depth of field, 8k resolution.\n\nUser Input: > 做一张咖啡店的海报，上面写着 \"Morning Coffee\"。\n\nOutput:\n\nA high-quality advertising poster design for a cozy coffee shop. The main subject is a steaming white ceramic cup filled with fresh coffee, placed on a wooden table near a rainy window. The text \"Morning Coffee\" is clearly visible in an elegant, bold serif font floating above the cup. The image has a warm, inviting tone with soft lighting and high contrast, vector art style composition.\n\nUser Input: > 这是一个赛博朋克风格的女孩，背景有霓虹灯，衣服上写着“未来”。\n\nOutput:\n\nA cinematic medium shot of a cyberpunk girl with mechanical facial parts standing in a futuristic rainy city street at night. She is wearing a high-tech translucent jacket that has the text \"未来\" clearly visible and glowing on the chest. The background is filled with vibrant pink and blue neon lights reflecting on the wet pavement. Volumetric lighting, ray tracing, highly detailed textures, masterpiece.\n\nUser Input: > 落霞与孤鹜齐飞，秋水共长天一色。\n\nOutput:\n\n落霞与孤鹜齐飞，秋水共长天一色. A breathtaking traditional Chinese landscape painting style. A solitary wild duck is flying across the vast sky against a backdrop of colorful sunset clouds. The autumn water below mirrors the sky, merging into one uniform color. Ink wash painting texture, ethereal atmosphere, soft gradients, oriental aesthetics, highly detailed scenery.\n\nConstraints\n\n输出必须是一段完整的、连贯的描述（Prompt Block）。\n\n不要分点列出，直接输出最终可以在模型中使用的 Prompt。", "masterpiece, ultra-HD, cinematic lighting, photorealistic, impressionism (1.5), high detail, depth of field, (blurred background), (dramatic lighting),masterpiece, best quality, very aesthetic, , 8k,,masterpiece, ultra-HD, cinematic lighting, high detail, depth of field, soft amazing composition,  1girl, red lifeguard bikini, 1boy, girl focus, man, 20 year old, sitting on beach chair, (girl sitting on lap), lifeguard bikini pulled to side, vaginal, stealth sex, cum, eyes rolling back, covering mouth, massive pectorals, huge penis penetration visible, legs closed, crowded beach, palm trees, beach umbrellas, detailed background", 0.6, 335, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "ref_image", "label": "ref_image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"widget": {"name": "api_baseurl"}, "name": "api_baseurl", "label": "api_baseurl", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "api_baseurl"}, {"widget": {"name": "api_key"}, "name": "api_key", "label": "api_key", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "api_key"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "role"}, "name": "role", "label": "role", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "role"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"},